OL,3,ABeauty advent calendars can cost
OL,4,Ahundreds but are they value for money?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's easy to see the appeal of a beauty
OL,7,Fadvent calendar. Like many women at
OL,8,Fthis time of year, Julia says she often
OL,9,Ffinds herself tempted to splurge on one
OL,10,F- especially a perfume calendar. But
OL,11,Fshe takes quite an unsentimental
OL,12,Fapproach.
OL,14,F"I always look at what's in them. If I
OL,15,Flike enough of the fragrances, I'll buy
OL,16,Fit," says the 39-year old, who works as
OL,17,Fa senior commercial manager in
OL,18,Fengineering.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
