OL,3,ABeauty advent calendars can cost
OL,4,Ahundreds but are they value for money?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuxury advent calendars are supposed to
OL,7,Foffer the thrill of a surprise but, for
OL,8,FJulia, it is more important she
OL,9,Factually wants the items inside - a
OL,10,Fthought that is also striking more and
OL,11,Fmore customers in the wake of the
OL,12,Fscandal over the Skims calendar.
OL,14,FThis week, Kim Kardashian's beauty
OL,15,Fbrand offered all of its customers
OL,16,Frefunds for its $148 (#110) calendar
OL,17,Fafter being widely criticised on social
OL,18,Fmedia over the quality of its contents,
OL,19,Fwith some customers likening the hair
OL,20,Fclips, scrunchies and keychains inside
OL,21,Fto things you might find down the back
OL,22,Fof a sofa.
